<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Attendance Bunk Simulator — Can I bunk tomorrow?</title>
<meta name="description" content="Know exactly how many classes you can bunk. Enter your attendance, simulate misses, see projected percentage, buffer & recovery plan. Built for 75% and any required attendance.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://example.com/">
<meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-snippet:160, max-image-preview:large">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#08080A">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://example.com/">
<meta property="og:title" content="Attendance Bunk Simulator — Can I bunk tomorrow?">
<meta property="og:description" content="Simulate bunking decisions. See exactly how many classes you can miss and stay above 75%.">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://example.com/og-image.png">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:title" content="Attendance Bunk Simulator — Can I bunk tomorrow?">
<meta name="twitter:description" content="Before you bunk, check the math. Current → Future → Decision.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='2' fill='%23E6E6E9'/%3E%3Ctext x='50%25' y='56%25' dominant-baseline='middle' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace' font-weight='700' font-size='16' fill='%2307070A'%3EB%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.webmanifest">
<style>
/* ========== REMIX-INSPIRED DARK EDITORIAL — ATTENDANCE OBSERVATORY ========== */
:root{
  --bg:#07080A;
  --bg-soft:#0C0C0F;
  --bg-elev:#111216;
  --surface:#12131A;
  --surface-2:#191A22;
  --surface-soft:#0F0F14;
  --border:#1C1C24;
  --border-strong:#2A2A36;
  --border-subtle:#14151C;
  --border-accent:#2DD4FF;
  --text:#E8E8EC;
  --text-strong:#FFFFFF;
  --muted:#8B8B96;
  --soft:#5D5D6A;
  --faint:#3A3A44;
  --on-invert:#FFFFFF;
  --brand:#2DD4FF;
  --brand-hover:#0EA5E9;
  --brand-soft:rgba(45,212,255,0.12);
  --brand-tint:rgba(45,212,255,0.18);
  --accent:#FF3B5D;
  --accent-soft:rgba(255,59,93,0.12);
  --success:#10B981;
  --success-dim:#065F46;
  --success-bg:rgba(16,185,129,0.10);
  --warning:#F59E0B;
  --danger:#FF3B5D;
  --danger-bg:rgba(255,59,93,0.10);
  --code-bg:#0A0A0F;
  --radius-sm:2px;
  --radius-md:4px;
  --radius-lg:6px;
  --radius-pill:9999px;
  --focus:0 0 0 1px #2DD4FF, 0 0 0 4px rgba(45,212,255,0.18);
  --focus-invert:0 0 0 1px #fff, 0 0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
  --ease-std:cubic-bezier(0.25,0.1,0.25,1);
  --ease-emph:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
  --dur-fast:140ms;
  --dur-std:240ms;
  --dur-slow:500ms;
  --font-display:"Space Grotesk", Inter, -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-body:Inter, -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-mono:"JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
  --page-width:1240px;
  --prose-width:720px;
  --gutter:24px;
  --gutter-m:16px;
  --header-h:64px;
  --section-y:96px;
  --section-y-m:64px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
*::selection{background:rgba(45,212,255,0.22);color:#fff}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:72px}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:var(--font-body);
  font-size:15px;
  line-height:1.6;
  color:var(--text);
  background:var(--bg);
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
a{color:var(--brand);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(45,212,255,0.35);transition:color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std), border-color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std)}
a:hover{color:#fff;border-color:var(--brand)}
img{max-width:100%}
button,input,select{font:inherit}
.skip{position:absolute;left:-9999px;top:8px;z-index:100;background:var(--text-strong);color:var(--bg);padding:10px 16px;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
.skip:focus{left:12px}
:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:var(--focus);border-color:var(--border-accent)!important}
.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}
.container{max-width:var(--page-width);margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--gutter)}
@media(max-width:640px){.container{padding:0 var(--gutter-m)}}
.grid12{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:24px}
@media(max-width:900px){.grid12{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}}
.prose{max-width:var(--prose-width)}

/* ========== HEADER — dark, mono, editorial ========== */
.header{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;
  height:var(--header-h);display:flex;align-items:center;
  background:rgba(7,8,10,0.92);
  backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
.header-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;width:100%}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none;border:0}
.logo-mark{width:28px;height:28px;background:var(--text-strong);color:var(--bg);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1}
.logo-type{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-strong)}
.logo-type span{font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:0.04em}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px}
.nav a{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;border:0;position:relative;padding:4px 0}
.nav a::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;width:100%;height:1px;background:var(--brand);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std)}
.nav a:hover{color:var(--text-strong)}
.nav a:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
.nav-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.btn{appearance:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 18px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);cursor:pointer;transition:all var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std);white-space:nowrap}
.btn:active{transform:scale(0.98)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--text-strong);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--text-strong)}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand);color:#000}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--muted);border-color:var(--border-strong)}
.btn-ghost:hover{color:var(--text-strong);border-color:var(--text-strong)}
.btn-brand{background:var(--brand);color:#000;border-color:var(--brand)}
.btn-brand:hover{background:#fff;border-color:#fff}
.btn-small{padding:8px 12px;font-size:11px}
.hamburger{display:none;width:40px;height:40px;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer}
.hamburger span,.hamburger span::before,.hamburger span::after{content:"";display:block;width:16px;height:1px;background:var(--text);position:relative;transition:all var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std)}
.hamburger span::before{position:absolute;top:-5px}
.hamburger span::after{position:absolute;top:5px}
@media(max-width:860px){.nav{display:none}.nav.open{display:flex;position:absolute;top:var(--header-h);left:0;right:0;background:var(--bg-soft);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;padding:20px var(--gutter-m);gap:16px}.nav.open a{font-size:12px}.hamburger{display:flex}}

/* ========== TYPOGRAPHY ========== */
.overline{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.overline::before{content:"";width:16px;height:1px;background:var(--brand);flex-shrink:0}
.overline-cyan{color:var(--brand)}
.display{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.04em;line-height:0.88}
.h-display{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(56px, 9vw, 126px);line-height:0.86;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:640px){.h-display{font-size:clamp(44px, 12vw, 64px);letter-spacing:-0.03em}}
.h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-0.03em;font-weight:700}
.h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:22px;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:600}
.body-lg{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);max-width:520px}
.mono{font-family:var(--font-mono)}
.mono-num{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-feature-settings:"tnum" 1}
.section-label{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--soft)}
.divider{height:1px;background:var(--border);margin:0}
.divider-strong{height:1px;background:var(--border-strong)}
.section-pad{padding:var(--section-y) 0}
@media(max-width:900px){.section-pad{padding:var(--section-y-m) 0}}
@media(max-width:640px){.section-pad{padding:48px 0}}

/* ========== HERO — editorial dark, grid, instrument ========== */
.hero{
  background:var(--bg);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
  padding:40px 0 0;
}
.hero::before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;inset:0;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size:32px 32px;
  mask-image:radial-gradient(800px 600px at 60% 20%, black 60%, transparent 85%);
  pointer-events:none;
}
.hero-glow{
  position:absolute;top:-40%;left:50%;width:120%;height:80%;
  background:radial-gradient(600px 400px at 50% 40%, rgba(45,212,255,0.08), transparent 70%);
  transform:translateX(-50%);pointer-events:none;
}
.hero-inner{position:relative}
.hero-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:48px;align-items:end;padding-bottom:32px}
@media(max-width:900px){.hero-top{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}}
.hero-head h1{margin:16px 0 0}
.hero-head h1 span.accent{color:var(--brand)}
.hero-head h1 i{font-style:normal;color:var(--text-strong);font-weight:500}
.hero-side{padding-bottom:8px;border-left:1px solid var(--border);padding-left:24px}
@media(max-width:900px){.hero-side{border-left:0;padding-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:16px}}
.hero-side p{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}
.hero-side em{color:var(--text);font-style:normal;border-bottom:1px solid var(--brand)}
.stats{display:flex;gap:24px;margin-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:16px}
.stat strong{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--text-strong);letter-spacing:-0.02em}
.stat span{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:2px}

/* ========== INSTRUMENT — dark console, not card ========== */
.instrument{
  background:var(--surface);
  border:1px solid var(--border-strong);
  border-left:3px solid var(--text-strong);
  margin-top:32px;
  position:relative;
}
.instrument-head{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;
  padding:14px 20px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  background:var(--surface-2);
}
.instrument-head strong{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand)}
.instrument-head em{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--soft);font-style:normal;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.instrument-head em::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--success);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--success);animation:blink 2s infinite}
@keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:0.4}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.instrument-head em::before{animation:none}}
.instrument-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr 1.1fr;
  gap:0;
  align-items:stretch;
}
@media(max-width:860px){.instrument-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr}}
@media(max-width:560px){.instrument-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}}
.instrument-field{
  padding:20px 20px 16px;
  border-right:1px solid var(--border);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;
}
.instrument-field:last-child{border-right:0}
@media(max-width:860px){.instrument-field:last-child{grid-column:1/-1;border-right:0;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}}
@media(max-width:560px){.instrument-field{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.instrument-field:last-child{border-bottom:0}}
.field-label{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.field-label small{color:var(--soft);letter-spacing:0.06em}
.field-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px}
.field-input{
  flex:1;
  background:transparent;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-strong);
  color:var(--text-strong);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:32px;font-weight:500;
  letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1;padding:6px 0 8px;
  outline:0;transition:border-color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std);
  width:100%;
}
.field-input:focus{border-color:var(--brand)}
.field-input[aria-invalid="true"]{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.field-suffix{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--soft);margin-top:10px}
.div-slash{
  display:grid;place-items:center;
  font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;color:var(--faint);padding:0 12px;
  border-right:1px solid var(--border);
}
@media(max-width:560px){.div-slash{display:none}}
.preset-rail{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:10px}
.preset{
  appearance:none;padding:6px 10px;
  background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--border);
  font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.04em;
  color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;transition:all var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std);
}
.preset:hover{border-color:var(--text);color:var(--text)}
.preset.active{background:var(--text-strong);border-color:var(--text-strong);color:var(--bg)}
.preset.active-blue{background:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand);color:#000}
.error-msg{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--accent);min-height:14px;margin-top:6px}

/* ========== RESULT STAGE — huge moment ========== */
.result-stage{
  border-top:1px solid var(--border);
  background:var(--bg-soft);
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;
  gap:0;
}
@media(max-width:860px){.result-stage{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.result-left{
  padding:28px 24px;
  border-right:1px solid var(--border);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;
}
@media(max-width:860px){.result-left{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}}
.pct-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.pct-big{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(48px, 7vw, 72px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.04em;line-height:0.9}
.pct-big small{font-size:0.5em;opacity:0.5;font-weight:500}
.pct-delta{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--muted)}
.pct-caption{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--soft);letter-spacing:0.02em}
.bar-wrap{margin-top:8px}
.pct-bar{height:2px;background:var(--border-strong);position:relative}
.pct-fill{height:100%;background:var(--brand);transition:width var(--dur-slow) var(--ease-emph)}
.pct-needle{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:2px;background:var(--text-strong);transform:translateX(-50%)}
.pct-needle em{position:absolute;bottom:100%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--text-strong);color:var(--bg);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 6px;white-space:nowrap;font-style:normal}
.result-right{
  padding:24px;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:14px;
  background:var(--surface);
}
.result-status{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.1}
.result-status small{display:block;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}
.result-desc{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}
.result-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:4px}
.meta-chip{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.04em;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:var(--muted)}
.result-banner.safe .result-status{color:var(--text-strong)}
.result-banner.warning .result-status{color:var(--warning)}
.result-banner.danger .result-status{color:var(--accent)}
.result-banner.neutral .result-status{color:var(--muted)}
.math-panel{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:14px 20px;background:var(--surface-soft);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}
.math-panel strong{color:var(--text)}
.math-panel .mono{color:var(--brand)}

/* ========== BUNK TOMORROW — inverted strip ========== */
.bunk-strip{
  border-top:1px solid var(--border);
  background:var(--bg);
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;
  gap:24px;align-items:center;
  padding:18px 20px;
}
@media(max-width:640px){.bunk-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.bunk-strip h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0}
.bunk-strip p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 0}
.bunk-answer{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:var(--surface-2);min-width:220px}
.bunk-answer.yes{border-color:rgba(16,185,129,0.4);color:#6EE7B7}
.bunk-answer.no{border-color:rgba(255,59,93,0.4);color:#FF8DA1}

/* ========== STRIP SECTIONS — open, not card ========== */
.strip{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.strip-head{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:20px}
.strip h2{margin:0}
.strip p.helper{color:var(--muted);max-width:520px}
.table-wrap{border:1px solid var(--border);overflow:auto}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;min-width:520px}
thead th{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);text-align:left;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface-soft);white-space:nowrap}
tbody td{padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-subtle);color:var(--text)}
tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
tbody tr:hover td{background:var(--surface-soft)}
tbody tr{cursor:pointer}
.status{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.04em;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid;display:inline-flex}
.status.ok{border-color:rgba(16,185,129,0.3);color:#6EE7B7;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.08)}
.status.bad{border-color:rgba(255,59,93,0.3);color:#FF8DA1;background:rgba(255,59,93,0.08)}

/* buffer as ruler */
.buffer{padding:var(--section-y) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.buffer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}
@media(max-width:860px){.buffer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}}
.bar-rail{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:20px;background:var(--surface-soft)}
.bar-track{height:8px;background:var(--border-strong);position:relative;display:flex;overflow:hidden}
.bar-seg{height:100%;transition:width var(--dur-slow) var(--ease-emph)}
.bar-labels{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.legend{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px;font-size:11px;font-family:var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.legend i{width:10px;height:10px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px}

/* ========== SIMULATOR PLAYGROUND ========== */
.playground{padding:var(--section-y) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.play-head{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:24px}
.sim-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:520px 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:1000px){.sim-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.sequencer{border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:var(--surface-soft)}
.seq-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface-2)}
.seq-title{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.seq-actions{display:flex;gap:8px}
.sim-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.sim-row{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr 40px;
  gap:12px;align-items:center;
  padding:12px 16px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  transition:background var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std);
}
.sim-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.sim-row.miss{background:rgba(255,59,93,0.06)}
.sim-row.attend{background:rgba(16,185,129,0.04)}
.sim-day{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.sim-day small{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:0.08em;display:block;color:var(--soft)}
.seg{display:flex;gap:6px}
.seg button{flex:1;padding:8px 12px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:transparent;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
.seg button.active-attend{background:var(--text-strong);border-color:var(--text-strong);color:var(--bg)}
.seg button.active-miss{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.rm{width:32px;height:32px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:transparent;color:var(--soft);cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center}
.rm:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.empty{border:1px dashed var(--border-strong);padding:40px 24px;text-align:center;background:transparent}
.empty strong{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}
.empty p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:0 0 16px}
.week-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px}
@media(max-width:640px){.week-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:6px}}
.week-day{border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:transparent;padding:14px 8px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std)}
.week-day strong{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;display:block}
.week-day span{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;margin-top:6px;display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface)}
.week-day.attend{border-color:var(--text-strong);background:var(--text-strong);color:var(--bg)}
.week-day.attend span{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);border-color:var(--bg)}
.week-day.miss{border-color:var(--accent);background:rgba(255,59,93,0.14);color:var(--accent)}
.outcome{border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:var(--surface);padding:20px;position:sticky;top:72px}
.outcome-label{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand)}
.outcome-pct{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:44px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1;margin-top:6px}
.outcome-caption{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
.mini-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:16px}
.mini{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:10px 12px;background:var(--surface-2)}
.mini em{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-style:normal;display:block;margin-bottom:4px}
.mini strong{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:14px}
.state-banner{margin-top:12px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}
.state-banner.safe{background:rgba(16,185,129,0.08);border-color:rgba(16,185,129,0.25);color:#6EE7B7}
.state-banner.warn{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.08);border-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.25);color:#FCD34D}
.state-banner.danger{background:rgba(255,59,93,0.08);border-color:rgba(255,59,93,0.25);color:#FF8DA1}
.state-banner .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor;margin-top:6px;flex-shrink:0}

/* ========== MANIFESTO BAND ========== */
.band{
  background:var(--text-strong);
  color:var(--bg);
  padding:80px 0;
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.band::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(700px 400px at 20% 0%, rgba(45,212,255,0.12), transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}
.band-inner{position:relative}
.band h2{color:var(--bg);margin:0 0 12px;font-family:var(--font-display)}
.band p{color:rgba(7,8,10,0.6);max-width:640px}
.band-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.12);margin-top:32px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08)}
@media(max-width:800px){.band-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.band-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.96);padding:24px}
.band-card h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:16px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.band-card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.6);margin:0}

/* ========== HOW / FAQ / FOOTER ========== */
.how{padding:var(--section-y) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.how-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 0.8fr;gap:32px;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:900px){.how-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.code-block{background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:14px 16px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);overflow:auto}
.code-block.invert{background:#000;border-color:#1A1A1A;color:#fff}
.faq{padding:var(--section-y) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-subtle)}
.faq-q{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;background:none;border:0;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);transition:color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std)}
.faq-q:hover{color:var(--brand)}
.faq-a{padding:0 0 16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}
.footer{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:40px 0;background:var(--bg-soft)}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 0.8fr 0.8fr 0.8fr;gap:32px}
@media(max-width:820px){.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:520px){.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.footer h4{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text);margin:0 0 12px}
.footer a,.footer p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;border:0}
.footer a:hover{color:var(--text)}
.foot-bottom{margin-top:32px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-subtle);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11px;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--soft);letter-spacing:0.02em}
.visual-rail{height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--brand), transparent 60%);opacity:0.5;margin:16px 0}

/* motion */
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip">Skip to content</a>
<header class="header" id="header" role="banner">
  <div class="container header-inner">
    <a href="#" class="logo" aria-label="Bunk home"><span class="logo-mark">B</span><span class="logo-type">BUNK <span>SIMULATOR</span></span></a>
    <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav"><span></span></button>
    <nav class="nav" id="nav" aria-label="Main">
      <a href="#calculator">01 — Instrument</a>
      <a href="#simulator">02 — Playground</a>
      <a href="#how-it-works">03 — Method</a>
      <a href="#faq">04 — FAQ</a>
      <div class="nav-cta">
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" id="shareBtn" type="button">Share</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-small" id="resetBtnTop" type="button">Reset</button>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-top">
      <div class="hero-head">
        <div class="overline">Decision instrument — no login — runs in browser</div>
        <h1 id="hero-title" class="h-display display">Can I<br><span class="accent">bunk</span><br>tomorrow<span style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;">?</span></h1>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-side">
        <p>Before you bunk, check the math. Current <em>→ Future → Decision</em>. Enter your attendance, see your buffer, simulate the next week.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a href="#calculator" class="btn btn-brand">Open instrument ↓</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-ghost">How it's calculated</a>
        </div>
        <div class="stats" aria-label="Facts">
          <div class="stat"><strong class="mono-num">37 / 44</strong><span>example — 84.09%</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>75%</strong><span>most common</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>∞</strong><span>simulations</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- INSTRUMENT -->
    <div class="instrument" id="calculator" aria-label="Attendance instrument">
      <div class="instrument-head">
        <strong>ATTENDANCE INSTRUMENT — LIVE</strong>
        <em>● Live calculation</em>
      </div>
      <div class="instrument-grid">
        <label class="instrument-field">
          <span class="field-label">Attended <small>≤ held</small></span>
          <span class="field-row"><input class="field-input" id="attended" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="0" step="1" value="37" aria-describedby="err-attended" autocomplete="off"></span>
          <span id="err-attended" class="error-msg" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></span>
        </label>
        <div class="div-slash" aria-hidden="true">/</div>
        <label class="instrument-field">
          <span class="field-label">Held <small>total</small></span>
          <span class="field-row"><input class="field-input" id="held" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="0" step="1" value="44" aria-describedby="err-held" autocomplete="off"></span>
          <span id="err-held" class="error-msg" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></span>
        </label>
        <label class="instrument-field">
          <span class="field-label">Required <small id="req-value-label">75%</small></span>
          <span class="field-row"><input class="field-input" id="required" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="100" step="0.5" value="75" style="font-size:28px"> <span class="field-suffix">%</span></span>
          <span class="preset-rail" role="group" aria-label="Quick required">
            <button type="button" class="preset" data-req="50">50</button>
            <button type="button" class="preset" data-req="60">60</button>
            <button type="button" class="preset" data-req="65">65</button>
            <button type="button" class="preset" data-req="70">70</button>
            <button type="button" class="preset active-blue" data-req="75">75</button>
            <button type="button" class="preset" data-req="80">80</button>
            <button type="button" class="preset" data-req="85">85</button>
            <button type="button" class="preset" data-req="90">90</button>
          </span>
          <span id="err-required" class="error-msg" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></span>
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="result-stage">
        <div class="result-left">
          <div class="section-label">Current attendance</div>
          <div class="pct-row">
            <div class="pct-big mono-num" id="pctBig">84.09<small>%</small></div>
            <span class="pct-delta" id="pctDelta">+9.09 pts above 75%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pct-caption" id="pctCaption">37 / 44 · 37 ÷ 44 × 100</div>
          <div class="bar-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="pct-bar"><div class="pct-fill" id="pctFill" style="width:84%"></div><i class="pct-needle" id="needle" style="left:75%"><em id="needleLabel">75% required</em></i></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="result-right">
          <div id="heroResult" class="result-banner safe" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="border:0;padding:0;background:transparent">
            <div class="result-status">
              <small id="resultKicker">You can miss 5 more classes</small>
              <span id="resultTitle">You're safe to bunk — buffer of 5.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="result-desc" id="resultDesc">After 5 misses you'll be at 75.51%. The 6th would drop you to 74.00%.</div>
            <div class="result-meta">
              <span class="meta-chip"><span id="metaBuffer">Buffer: 5 classes</span></span>
              <span class="meta-chip"><span id="metaProjected">After 5 bunks: 37/49 = 75.51%</span></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Formula</span>
            <span class="mono" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--brand);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:2px 6px">A ÷ (H+m) ≥ R</span>
            <button type="button" id="showMath" style="background:none;border:0;padding:0;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;font-size:11px;font-family:var(--font-mono)">How?</button>
          </div>
          <div id="mathExplain" hidden style="margin-top:10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface-2);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)">
            <strong style="color:var(--text)">Max misses:</strong> largest <span class="mono" style="color:var(--brand)">m</span> with <span class="mono">A/(H+m) ≥ R</span> — check <span class="mono">A×100 ≥ R×(H+m)</span>.<br>
            <strong style="color:var(--text)">Recovery:</strong> smallest <span class="mono" style="color:var(--brand)">x</span> with <span class="mono">(A+x)/(H+x) ≥ R</span>.<br>
            <span class="mono" id="mathExample" style="color:var(--muted)">37/(44+5)=75.51% ✓ · 37/(44+6)=74.00% ✗ → buffer 5</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bunk-strip" aria-live="polite">
        <div>
          <div class="section-label" style="color:var(--brand)">Tomorrow's call</div>
          <h3>Can I bunk tomorrow?</h3>
          <p id="bunkDesc" style="margin:0">Check what a single miss does — instantly.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;min-width:240px">
          <button class="btn btn-brand" id="bunkBtn" type="button" style="width:100%">Can I bunk tomorrow? →</button>
          <div id="bunkResult" class="bunk-answer yes" role="status">
            <strong id="bunkAnswer">Yes — you can bunk tomorrow.</strong><br>
            <span id="bunkDetail" style="opacity:0.7">37/45 = 82.22%, still above 75%.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="strip">
  <div class="container section-pad">
    <div class="strip-head">
      <div><div class="section-label">Quick simulations</div><h2 class="h3" id="quick-title" style="margin:6px 0 0">If I miss…</h2><p class="helper">Tap a row to load it into the playground.</p></div>
      <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:6px 10px">Auto-updates</span>
    </div>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table aria-label="Quick bunk scenarios">
        <thead><tr><th>Missed</th><th>Projected</th><th>Math</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="quickBody"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="buffer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="strip-head"><div><div class="section-label">Attendance buffer</div><h2 class="h2" style="margin:6px 0 0">How much room do you have?</h2></div></div>
    <p class="helper" id="bufferDesc" style="max-width:560px">Your buffer is <strong style="color:var(--text)">5 classes</strong>. You could miss 5 and still stay at 75%.</p>
    <div class="bar-rail">
      <div class="bar-track" id="bufferBar" role="img" aria-label="Buffer visualization"></div>
      <div class="bar-labels"><span id="bufLeft" class="mono-num">37 attended</span><span id="bufRight" class="mono-num">44 held</span></div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px;font-size:11px;font-family:var(--font-mono)">
        <div><div style="color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase">Required line</div><strong id="bufRequired" style="color:var(--text)">33 of 44 needed for 75%</strong></div>
        <div><div style="color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase">After buffer used</div><strong id="bufAfter" style="color:var(--text)">37/49 = 75.51%</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="legend" aria-hidden="true">
        <span><i style="background:var(--text-strong)"></i> Attended</span>
        <span><i style="background:var(--border-strong)"></i> Not attended</span>
        <span><i style="background:var(--brand)"></i> Buffer</span>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
        <span id="bufferBadge" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);color:var(--muted)">SAFE</span>
        <span id="bufferHelper" class="helper">Large buffer — breathing room.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="playground" id="simulator" aria-labelledby="sim-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="play-head">
      <div><div class="section-label">02 — Playground</div><h2 id="sim-title" class="h2">Build your week</h2><p class="helper" style="max-width:480px">Toggle Attend / Miss. This is an instrument — the numbers react instantly. Share the URL to keep the same state.</p></div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" id="addClass" type="button">+ Add class</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" id="addWeek" type="button">+ Add week</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" id="clearSim" type="button">Clear</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sim-grid">
      <div class="sequencer">
        <div class="seq-head">
          <span class="seq-title">Sequence — Mon → Sun</span>
          <span id="projClasses" class="mono-num" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">0 classes</span>
        </div>
        <div id="simList" class="sim-list" role="group" aria-label="Future classes"></div>
        <div id="simEmpty" class="empty" hidden>
          <strong>No steps yet.</strong>
          <p>Add upcoming classes to hear how your attendance trajectory changes.</p>
          <button class="btn btn-brand btn-small" id="emptyAdd" type="button">Add first step</button>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
          <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:8px">Weekly bunk planner</div>
          <div class="week-grid" id="weekGrid" role="group" aria-label="This week"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="outcome">
        <div class="outcome-label">Projected outcome</div>
        <div class="outcome-pct mono-num" id="projPct">84.09%</div>
        <div class="outcome-caption" id="projCaption">37 / 44 · no future classes</div>
        <div class="bar-track" style="margin-top:12px;height:4px"><div class="pct-fill" id="projFill" style="width:84%"></div></div>
        <div class="mini-grid">
          <div class="mini"><em>Before</em><strong id="projBefore" class="mono-num">84.09%</strong></div>
          <div class="mini"><em>After</em><strong id="projAfter" class="mono-num">84.09%</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div id="projDelta" class="state-banner safe" style="margin-top:12px">
          <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span><strong id="projKicker">No change</strong><br><span id="projDesc" style="color:var(--muted)">Add future classes to simulate.</span></span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <span class="meta-chip"><span id="projRemaining">Buffer after: 5</span></span>
          <span class="meta-chip"><span id="projNeedle" style="display:none">75%</span></span>
        </div>
        <div id="recoveryBox" hidden style="margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:16px">
          <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)">Recovery mode</div>
          <div id="recoveryText" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted)"></div>
          <div class="table-wrap" style="margin-top:12px">
            <table aria-label="Recovery scenarios">
              <thead><tr><th>Attend next</th><th>Result</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody id="recoveryBody"></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container" id="recoverySection" hidden aria-live="polite" style="padding:24px 0">
  <div style="border:1px solid var(--accent);padding:16px;background:rgba(255,59,93,0.08);display:flex;gap:12px">
    <span style="width:32px;height:32px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700">!</span>
    <div><div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)">Below required</div><div id="recoveryTitle" style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;margin:4px 0">Attend the next 12 classes to reach 75%.</div><div id="recoveryDesc" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">You're at 68.18% (30/44). Recovery is exact.</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" aria-label="Why this simulator">
  <div class="container band-inner">
    <div class="section-label" style="color:rgba(0,0,0,0.5)">WHY IT'S DIFFERENT</div>
    <h2 class="h2" style="color:#000">Less calculator.<br>More decision simulator.</h2>
    <p>Most sites give you a percentage and leave you to do the risk math. Bunk tells you what happens tomorrow, how far your buffer stretches, and what your week looks like if you miss Monday and Wednesday — before you decide.</p>
    <div class="band-grid">
      <div class="band-card"><h3>Current → Future → Decision</h3><p>Enter 37/44, get “miss 5 more” plus the 6th-class cliff (74%). No mental math.</p></div>
      <div class="band-card"><h3>Tomorrow in one tap</h3><p>“Can I bunk tomorrow?” is the hero action — instant Yes/No with the exact projected %.</p></div>
      <div class="band-card"><h3>Simulate, don't guess</h3><p>Toggle Attend/Miss for each future class. Weekly view and shareable URL included.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">03 — Method</div>
    <h2 id="how-title" class="h2" style="margin:8px 0 12px">The math is simple.<br>The consequences matter.</h2>
    <p class="helper" style="max-width:640px">Everything runs locally. Formulas are integer-safe with epsilon correction.</p>
    <div class="how-grid" style="margin-top:32px">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);padding:20px">
          <h3 class="h3" style="font-size:16px;margin:0 0 6px">1. Current attendance</h3>
          <p class="helper" style="margin:0 0 10px"><span class="mono" style="border:1px solid var(--border);padding:2px 6px">A ÷ H × 100</span></p>
          <div class="code-block invert">37 ÷ 44 × 100 = 84.09%</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);padding:20px">
          <h3 class="h3" style="font-size:16px;margin:0 0 6px">2. Max classes you can miss</h3>
          <p class="helper" style="margin:0 0 10px">Largest <span class="mono">m</span> with <span class="mono">A/(H+m) ≥ R</span></p>
          <div class="code-block invert">37/(44+5)=75.51% ✓ · 37/(44+6)=74.00% ✗</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);padding:20px">
          <h3 class="h3" style="font-size:16px;margin:0 0 6px">3. Recovery</h3>
          <p class="helper" style="margin:0 0 10px">Smallest <span class="mono">x</span> with <span class="mono">(A+x)/(H+x) ≥ R</span></p>
          <div class="code-block invert">30/44=68.18% → need 12 → 42/56=75.00%</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);padding:20px">
          <h3 class="h3" style="font-size:16px;margin:0 0 6px">4. Future simulation</h3>
          <p class="helper" style="margin:0">(A+a)/(H+a+m) — every toggle recomputes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);padding:20px;background:var(--surface-soft)">
          <div class="section-label">Why one miss can hurt</div>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0">With small H, one bunk swings a lot. At 37/44, missing 1 drops 1.87 pts. At 80/100, just 0.79.</p>
          <div class="visual-rail"></div>
          <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Quick mental formula</div>
          <div class="code-block" style="margin-top:8px">Required held for R%: ceil(A×100÷R)<br>Remaining buffer ≈ ceil(A×100÷R) − H</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);padding:16px;margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:12px;font-family:var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase">Try these presets</h4>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">
            <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small preset-demo" data-a="37" data-h="44" data-r="75" type="button">37/44 · 75%</button>
            <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small preset-demo" data-a="30" data-h="44" data-r="75" type="button">30/44 · recovery</button>
            <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small preset-demo" data-a="75" data-h="100" data-r="75" type="button">75/100 · edge</button>
            <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-small preset-demo" data-a="18" data-h="20" data-r="80" type="button">18/20 · 80%</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px">
    <div class="section-label">04 — FAQ</div>
    <h2 id="faq-title" class="h2" style="margin:8px 0 24px">Student questions,<br>answered</h2>
    <details class="faq-item" open>
      <summary class="faq-q">How is attendance percentage calculated? <span aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:0.5">—</span></summary>
      <div class="faq-a"><p>Divide attended by held and multiply by 100: <span class="mono">A ÷ H × 100</span>. Example: 37 ÷ 44 × 100 = 84.09%.</p></div>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary class="faq-q">How many classes can I miss and stay above 75%? <span aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:0.5">—</span></summary>
      <div class="faq-a"><p>Largest <span class="mono">m</span> with <span class="mono">A/(H+m) ≥ 75%</span>. For 37/44, that's 5 misses (37/49 = 75.51%).</p></div>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary class="faq-q">What if I'm already below 75% — how many must I attend? <span aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:0.5">—</span></summary>
      <div class="faq-a"><p>Smallest <span class="mono">x</span> with <span class="mono">(A+x)/(H+x) ≥ R</span>. Example: 30/44 needs 12 straight attends to reach 75%.</p></div>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary class="faq-q">What is “attendance buffer”? <span aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:0.5">—</span></summary>
      <div class="faq-a"><p>How many classes you can miss before falling below required %. <strong>Safe</strong> (≥4), <strong>Close</strong> (2–3), <strong>Critical</strong> (1), <strong>Below</strong> (recovery).</p></div>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary class="faq-q">Is my data saved or sent anywhere? <span aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:0.5">—</span></summary>
      <div class="faq-a"><p>No. Everything runs locally. URL sharing is optional and encodes numbers in the address bar.</p></div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container" style="padding:24px 0">
  <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);padding:16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px">
    <span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Know before you bunk. Your attendance. Your call — with the math clear.</span>
    <a href="#calculator" class="btn btn-primary">Back to instrument</a>
  </div>
</div>
</main>

